1
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,750
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:45,880
[Episode 17]

4
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,680
I guess

5
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,150
Xuanyuan Shan will eventually find out

6
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:51,479
that it was me who told

7
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:52,560
the Crown Prince about
the government salt.

8
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,350
I bet

9
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,350
she'll probably come looking for trouble.

10
00:01:56,350 --> 00:01:58,590
Who does Xuanyuan Shan think she is?

11
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,940
No need to wait any longer.

12
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,950
Let's settle the score right now.

13
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,590
Chief Xuanyuan.

14
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,000
Chief Xuanyuan.

15
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:15,630
I was just talking nonsense.

16
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,030
Please don't take it to heart.

17
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,050
Thank you, Chief Xuanyuan.

18
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:26,360
I'll take my leave now.

19
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:28,280
Li Qingyang,

20
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,150
I can't protect you.

21
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,630
You're on your own.

22
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:44,079
The Mingling case
involves the royal family.

23
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:45,560
It should have been
investigated thoroughly

24
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,120
before it was submitted to His Majesty.

25
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,960
Li Qingyang,

26
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,310
you actually handed over the case evidence

27
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,910
to the Crown Prince privately.

28
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:54,440
Do you know what a huge trouble
you've caused?

29
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:59,190
If a prince breaks the law,
he gets the same penalty as the commoners.

30
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:01,910
The evidence of the Mingling case
is conclusive.

31
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:03,910
The First Prince deserves it.

32
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,910
Whether His Majesty learned of it

33
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,000
sooner or later—

34
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,180
what difference does it make?

35
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,520
Go on.

36
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:13,960
If this case

37
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,630
was submitted by
the Divine Constable Bureau,

38
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,430
I think

39
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:18,680
His Majesty, to balance
the power in the court,

40
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,240
would definitely
protect the First Prince once.

41
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,030
So,

42
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:23,750
it's better to leak this news

43
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:25,000
to the Crown Prince

44
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:27,870
and let him take the lead.

45
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,840
This way,

46
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:32,280
not only is the First Prince punished,

47
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,560
but it also clears the relationship

48
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,490
with the Divine Constable Bureau.

49
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:37,910
Chief Xuanyuan.,

50
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,960
actually, I am just

51
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,560
solving problems for you.

52
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,680
Chief Xuanyuan,

53
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:03,410
there is one more thing

54
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,360
I still can't figure out.

55
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,520
Before His Majesty issued an edict

56
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,120
to punish the First Prince,

57
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:12,660
the government salt matter

58
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:14,680
had already spread among the people.

59
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,750
I once sent people

60
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:18,310
to secretly investigate
the source of the news,

61
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,970
but could never track it down.

62
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:22,630
You mean

63
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,270
besides you,

64
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,530
someone else leaked the news?

65
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,120
I think

66
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,159
this person must hope

67
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:36,750
to cause chaos in the Great Shi's court.

68
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,800
Isn't that

69
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,830
the same as you?

70
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:49,240
I wouldn't dare.

71
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:53,750
Think about it. The government salt matter

72
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:56,040
is known to only a few people.

73
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,560
I guess

74
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,830
this person either has been

75
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,670
following us from the start,

76
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,480
or

77
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:05,510
he is from the Divine Constable Bureau.

78
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,160
I see.

79
00:05:10,770 --> 00:05:13,500
If there's anything else,
just say it all at once.

80
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:19,020
There is indeed one more thing
I want to ask of you.

81
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:20,960
[Winter's Haven]

82
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:25,310
How did it go? What did the Chief say?

83
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,010
After much persuasion,

84
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:27,870
she finally agreed

85
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:29,310
to let Xia Jiuying stay.

86
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,360
However,

87
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:32,870
the Chief has her own arrangements.

88
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,120
That's good.

89
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:34,720
At least she has

90
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,950
a place to stay.

91
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,510
Our trip to Mingling this time

92
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,640
can be considered an unexpected gain.

93
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,510
The Dark Night Organization

94
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,950
wanted to kill Jiuying to silence her

95
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:44,680
because they were afraid she would

96
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,159
reveal the location of the cave,

97
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:47,070
thereby exposing

98
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:49,070
their mutation of the demon wolves.

99
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,560
Having demon-men isn't enough.

100
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,690
They want to cultivate more monsters.

101
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,310
I'm worried that next,

102
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,159
Liluo will make a major move.

103
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,390
Right.

104
00:05:57,870 --> 00:06:00,240
Our division must be

105
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,680
on high alert these next few days.

106
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,460
The details of the Mingling case,

107
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:16,770
from beginning to end,

108
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,510
are known only to
the Divine Constable Bureau.

109
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,600
I didn't expect

110
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,630
you to know it so clearly.

111
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,160
Everything I do

112
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,760
is for the Holy Lord.

113
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:32,050
The Great Shi Dynasty
must be thrown into chaos.

114
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,050
The more chaotic it is,

115
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:38,070
the more advantageous it is for us.

116
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:42,080
In this Tianhuang City,

117
00:06:42,730 --> 00:06:44,860
when it comes to being well-informed,

118
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:46,820
no one can compare to Li Qingyang.

119
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,770
If you spread news privately,

120
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,560
aren't you afraid

121
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,120
he will suspect you?

122
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:59,950
What do I have to be afraid of?

123
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,360
His life

124
00:07:04,450 --> 00:07:07,680
is in my hands.

125
00:07:13,970 --> 00:07:16,110
[Tianshu Pavilion]

126
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:45,360
Has the God of Lies, Qipi,

127
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:48,040
also turned to dust?

128
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,600
Chief.

129
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,830
I called you here

130
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,040
to let you meet someone.

131
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,310
Who?

132
00:08:25,430 --> 00:08:26,240
Jiuying?

133
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:30,310
I initially wanted to
arrange a place for her,

134
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,560
but after spending a few days with her,

135
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:34,020
I found she is agile and quick-witted.

136
00:08:34,049 --> 00:08:35,590
She's good material for a constable.

137
00:08:35,590 --> 00:08:37,960
I'll keep her in the division
and teach her myself,

138
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,600
starting as a trainee constable.

139
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,780
I have to say,

140
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:43,840
Jiuying looks quite good in this outfit.

141
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,730
It's great that she can stay.

142
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,290
Quick, thank the Chief.

143
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,790
Thank you, Chief.

144
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,590
Oh no. It's the Tianshu Pavilion.

145
00:09:25,850 --> 00:09:27,100
A Liluo man?

146
00:09:28,710 --> 00:09:30,200
To think you can come and go freely

147
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,410
in the Tianshu Pavilion.

148
00:09:31,410 --> 00:09:33,910
[Tianshu Pavilion]

149
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,360
Who exactly are you?

150
00:09:34,750 --> 00:09:36,910
Unless he's from
the Divine Constable Bureau.

151
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,320
Just like Lou Tianming,

152
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:39,270
he's a mole planted

153
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:41,140
by Liluo in the Divine Constable Bureau.

154
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:42,340
I don't care who he is.

155
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:43,670
Let's capture him first!

156
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,660
Stop!

157
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,200
Let him go.

158
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,360
Chief, he's from Liluo.

159
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,750
He is extremely audacious.

160
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:53,200
He trespassed into the Tianshu Pavilion.

161
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,910
I don't need to explain to you.

162
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,510
What happened
at the Tianshu Pavilion today

163
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:58,320
must not be revealed to anyone.

164
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,720
Otherwise, you will be severely punished.

165
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,030
Did you hear me?

166
00:10:08,510 --> 00:10:09,320
-Yes.
-Yes.

167
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:27,760
What's going on?

168
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:37,270
If word gets out

169
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:41,000
that I came to see you tonight...

170
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,900
Just do your job.

171
00:10:47,010 --> 00:10:48,330
No one in the Divine Constable Bureau

172
00:10:48,330 --> 00:10:49,730
will stand in your way.

173
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:53,800
Now that the First Prince has lost power,

174
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,640
there's an undercurrent at court.

175
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:58,510
It is a time of change.

176
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,960
Chief, don't miss this chance.

177
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,680
Such lightness skill

178
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,610
is truly incredible.

179
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,080
Don't worry.

180
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,790
I know who that kid is.

181
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,320
I'll handle him.

182
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:38,200
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

183
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,790
Master.

184
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:47,630
Ask the girls to work a little harder

185
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:48,960
and find someone for me.

186
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:50,200
Please tell me, Master.

187
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,480
He's a middle-aged man

188
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,360
with rather delicate features.

189
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:54,250
He's not actually that old,

190
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,870
just unkempt,

191
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,490
so he looks older than he is.

192
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,260
His martial arts are not weak either.

193
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,360
I want to know all his movements

194
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,550
after he entered Tianhuang City.

195
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:05,360
Yes.

196
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:08,110
The girls have checked
all the martial artists

197
00:12:08,110 --> 00:12:09,150
going in and out of

198
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:10,320
Tianhuang City.

199
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:12,920
There really aren't many experts

200
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,000
who match your description:

201
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,080
a square face, small eyes,

202
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,320
looks old but is actually

203
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,240
middle-aged.

204
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,630
Although most of them
have no fixed residence,

205
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:21,400
they all have names in jianghu.

206
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:23,260
Only one among them stands out—

207
00:12:23,260 --> 00:12:25,550
his identity is mysterious,
and his background unknown.

208
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:26,510
But he has been living in the same place

209
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:28,000
for several days in a row.

210
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,480
Where?

211
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Lanyue Pavilion.

212
00:12:41,130 --> 00:12:46,610
[Lanyue Pavilion]

213
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,080
Everyone,

214
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,630
former Minister of Works, Tang Yiming,

215
00:12:45,630 --> 00:12:46,790
Master Tang,

216
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,860
was the best craftsman in the world
before he entered the government.

217
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,200
He was an expert

218
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,930
in mechanics and landscaping.

219
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:57,520
He was known as
the reincarnation of Lu Ban.

220
00:12:59,550 --> 00:13:00,670
After resigning,

221
00:13:00,790 --> 00:13:03,600
he spent 5 years drawing blueprints.

222
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:05,960
He and his son, Tang Wei,

223
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,600
spent six years

224
00:13:07,090 --> 00:13:09,290
[Lanyue Pavilion]

225
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:10,870
building the number one pavilion
in the Great Shi.

226
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,630
Counting the days,

227
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:18,080
[Lanyue Pavilion]

228
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:15,280
Lanyue Pavilion
has been built for ten years.

229
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:19,030
From the top, you can see
all the scenery of Tianhuang City.

230
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,680
It's said that

231
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:23,630
you can even see
the imperial palace clearly.

232
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:27,150
Before the construction
of Lanyue Pavilion,

233
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:29,320
an imperial censor once
submitted a memorial,

234
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,750
arguing that a hundred-foot tower
towering above the palace

235
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:33,630
was a great act of disrespect.

236
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:33,960
Yes.

237
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,510
Indeed.

238
00:13:34,510 --> 00:13:36,080
How could it be taller than the palace?

239
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,910
But our wise His Majesty

240
00:13:37,690 --> 00:13:42,610
[Lanyue Pavilion]

241
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:39,720
didn't care.

242
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,720
He even wrote 8 big characters.

243
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,270
Which 8 characters?

244
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,480
Yes, tell us.

245
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,960
Harmony between ruler and subject—

246
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:51,080
what's wrong with that?

247
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,120
What... What does this mean?

248
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,540
-And then?
-And then?

249
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,840
-Yes, what happened next?
-And then?

250
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,840
Keep going.

251
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,440
Tell us.

252
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,360
If you want to know what happened next,

253
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:02,750
listen to the next chapter.

254
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,360
[Lanyue Pavilion]

255
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:13,840
Zhenzhu.

256
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:15,670
Li Si?

257
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:17,240
Why are you here?

258
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:19,000
Every early autumn,

259
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:19,910
naturally,

260
00:14:20,130 --> 00:14:23,100
[Lanyue Pavilion]

261
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:22,150
the lantern festival at Lanyue Pavilion

262
00:14:22,150 --> 00:14:23,200
is the liveliest.

263
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,000
How could I miss it?

264
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:27,670
Let me help you.

265
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:50,210
[Lanyue Pavilion]

266
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:21,830
[Lanyue Pavilion]

267
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:20,480
Just now,

268
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,200
what did you wish for?

269
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:25,510
I wished for the Great Shi Dynasty to have

270
00:15:25,510 --> 00:15:28,240
peace in the world
and prosperity for the people.

271
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,390
A good wish.

272
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,510
Since we're here,

273
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:43,240
why don't

274
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:46,550
we stroll around Lanyue Pavilion?

275
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:47,410
How about that?

276
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,090
Let's go.

277
00:15:48,110 --> 00:15:49,000
Let's go.

278
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:58,130
[Lanyue Pavilion]

279
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,510
This Lanyue Pavilion

280
00:16:31,510 --> 00:16:33,600
is a business from 10 years ago.

281
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,510
It's too formal

282
00:16:36,150 --> 00:16:37,240
and lacks novelty,

283
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:38,510
so its foot traffic

284
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:41,310
is naturally less than
Star-Gathering Pavilion.

285
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,600
I wonder if you've heard

286
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:45,790
a strange tale.

287
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:49,510
The boss of Lanyue Pavilion is Tang Wei,

288
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:50,750
and he has quite a background.

289
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:51,480
His father

290
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,150
was the former Minister of Works.

291
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:55,120
He resigned years ago to seek the Dao.

292
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,510
It's said he was enlightened

293
00:16:56,510 --> 00:16:57,960
and ascended to become an immortal.

294
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,750
An old servant saw with his own eyes

295
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:00,840
a mechanical wooden bird

296
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:01,840
circling a rainbow

297
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:04,240
and carrying Master Tang's body
to the sky.

298
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:06,750
This alarmed His Majesty

299
00:17:06,829 --> 00:17:08,160
and the Chief.

300
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:11,240
Unfortunately, the Divine Constable Bureau
searched for days

301
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,300
but found neither Master Tang's body

302
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:14,310
nor

303
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,000
the wreckage of the wooden bird.

304
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,460
A mechanical wooden bird?

305
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,030
Could Master Tang

306
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:22,480
be the reincarnation of Lu Ban?

307
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,109
I have never believed

308
00:17:24,109 --> 00:17:25,400
in ghosts and gods.

309
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,720
Young Master Qingyang,

310
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,920
you are right.

311
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:32,880
My master indeed attained immortality.

312
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,030
You are?

313
00:17:35,310 --> 00:17:37,730
[Qin Dayuan, Butler of Tang Manor]

314
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:38,280
The butler of the Tang residence—
Qin Dayuan.

315
00:17:41,550 --> 00:17:42,640
You recognize me?

316
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:44,160
My young master ordered me to be here

317
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,590
to wait for you.

318
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:51,830
Please.

319
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,920
Butler Qin,

320
00:18:10,350 --> 00:18:12,070
how did Young Master Tang know

321
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,830
I would come to visit?

322
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:16,270
My young master calculated

323
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:18,790
that you would come on his birthday.

324
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:20,640
Over the years, the young master

325
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,590
has never miscalculated.

326
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,880
I don't believe in ghosts or gods,

327
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,930
nor do I believe in
divination or prophecies.

328
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:33,350
Young Master Qingyang relies on being

329
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:35,570
[Shuyue Residence]

330
00:18:33,350 --> 00:18:35,510
the Crown Prince's favorite

331
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,200
to slander gods and immortals here.

332
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,610
You should know that

333
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:42,310
when I served the Crown Prince,

334
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:44,480
he wasn't even born yet.

335
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:48,750
Such a mortal with no connection
to immortals,

336
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,000
why bother with him?

337
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,480
It's better to drink elixirs in the forest

338
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:54,240
and retreat to the mountains.

339
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,830
No, no, no.

340
00:18:55,580 --> 00:19:00,330
[Shuyue Residence]

341
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,510
Retreating to the deep mountains

342
00:18:58,510 --> 00:19:00,840
cannot isolate me from the secular world.

343
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:03,270
Why not go and return?

344
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:07,590
Who are these two?

345
00:19:08,030 --> 00:19:08,920
These are

346
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:11,400
some of the young master's friends.

347
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,330
You don't need to pay them any mind.

348
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,500
It doesn't matter.

349
00:19:16,810 --> 00:19:19,550
[Shuyue Residence]

350
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,550
The young master
has been waiting on the seventh floor

351
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,920
for a long time.

352
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,850
Please, Master.

353
00:19:24,310 --> 00:19:25,160
Thank you.

354
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:33,150
[Sixth Floor]

355
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:19,240
You must be Tang Wei, Boss Tang?

356
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,790
Today is your birthday.

357
00:20:25,550 --> 00:20:26,920
I came in a hurry

358
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,490
and didn't prepare a gift.

359
00:20:29,750 --> 00:20:32,080
The day of arrival
is the day of departure.

360
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:34,310
What is there to rejoice in arriving,

361
00:20:34,310 --> 00:20:36,310
and what is there to grieve in departing?

362
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,840
With neither grief nor joy,

363
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:40,200
why prepare a gift?

364
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:45,060
My words were inappropriate;

365
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,240
please forgive me.

366
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:50,030
I lack spiritual insight.

367
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,240
However,

368
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:53,560
from what you're saying,

369
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,640
your birthday

370
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,560
is about to become your death anniversary.

371
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,160
A few days ago,

372
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:07,750
my father appeared in a dream
from the heavenly realm,

373
00:21:07,750 --> 00:21:08,640
saying,

374
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:11,240
the day of arrival
is the day of departure.

375
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,440
He prophesied that on my birthday,

376
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:16,170
I would pass on to the heavenly realm.

377
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:18,310
Boss Tang,

378
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,700
midnight is approaching.

379
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:24,770
But looking at you,

380
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:27,880
aren't you perfectly fine?

381
00:21:35,890 --> 00:21:37,790
[Tang Wei]

382
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:42,960
Beautiful moonlight, beautiful night.

383
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:48,730
How about enjoying it
with me, Young Master Qingyang?

384
00:21:49,830 --> 00:21:51,550
If it's truly as you say,

385
00:21:51,790 --> 00:21:53,320
and your days are numbered,

386
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:56,060
you should spend them with your family.

387
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:58,960
I am neither family nor friend.

388
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:02,030
It seems quite inconvenient.

389
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:06,410
Young Master Qingyang and I

390
00:22:07,070 --> 00:22:09,310
are both people
who cannot see our past clearly.

391
00:22:09,310 --> 00:22:10,480
That's why I say

392
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:14,440
we are fated to meet.

393
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:18,480
What do you mean
by not seeing the past clearly?

394
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:22,830
Since it cannot be seen clearly,

395
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:25,280
how can it be explained clearly?

396
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:29,920
Back to the point.

397
00:22:30,310 --> 00:22:31,490
Butler Qin said

398
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:33,640
you've been waiting for me here
for a long time.

399
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,480
I wonder,

400
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:36,760
what advice do you have, Boss Tang?

401
00:22:37,030 --> 00:22:39,550
I have something to give you.

402
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:57,440
I can't accept a reward without merit.

403
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,750
What if I say this item

404
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:03,030
is related to Liluo?

405
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,240
Did you see Boss Tang?

406
00:23:26,830 --> 00:23:27,640
What did you talk about

407
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:28,640
for so long?

408
00:23:28,410 --> 00:23:32,790
[Lanyue Pavilion]

409
00:23:31,830 --> 00:23:35,790
This Lanyue Pavilion
is connected to Liluo.

410
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,000
Why do you say that?

411
00:23:45,030 --> 00:23:46,830
This was given to me by Boss Tang.

412
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,270
He said...

413
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:50,560
This item is related to Liluo.

414
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:01,640
I still don't know

415
00:24:02,270 --> 00:24:03,640
what this really is,

416
00:24:03,830 --> 00:24:04,640
and

417
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,600
what Boss Tang's purpose

418
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:10,640
in giving it to me

419
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:12,160
really is.

420
00:24:12,270 --> 00:24:12,760
[Lanyue Pavilion]

421
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:14,230
[Lanyue Pavilion]

422
00:24:28,710 --> 00:24:33,850
[Lanyue Pavilion]

423
00:24:28,830 --> 00:24:31,720
Something happened!

424
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:34,000
Someone fell from above!

425
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,160
Young Master!

426
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:39,400
Young Master!

427
00:24:39,510 --> 00:24:40,480
Boss Tang.

428
00:24:42,340 --> 00:24:44,710
Young Master!

429
00:25:01,650 --> 00:25:04,510
[Lanyue Pavilion Ascension Case]

430
00:25:04,540 --> 00:25:11,350
[Lanyue Pavilion]

431
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:09,530
Keep an eye on everything.

432
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:18,550
How is it?

433
00:25:21,270 --> 00:25:22,930
Skull, sternum, and leg bones

434
00:25:23,030 --> 00:25:24,410
have multiple fractures.

435
00:25:24,410 --> 00:25:26,000
The cause of death
is falling from a height.

436
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,110
I just don't know if he fell on his own

437
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:30,960
or was pushed.

438
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:34,230
[Lanyue Pavilion]

439
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:35,880
As for the footprints in the room,

440
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:37,240
besides Tang Wei, Qin Dayuan,

441
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,240
and Li Si's,

442
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,680
there's a fourth one.

443
00:25:48,510 --> 00:25:50,110
What are you thinking about?

444
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:51,270
There are three people

445
00:25:51,270 --> 00:25:53,270
who need to be watched immediately.

446
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:55,160
Qin Dayuan and

447
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:59,240
the two guests
in the sixth-floor private room.

448
00:25:59,020 --> 00:25:59,590
[Lanyue Pavilion]

449
00:26:03,510 --> 00:26:05,510
People down there, step back!

450
00:26:06,070 --> 00:26:06,720
Step back, everyone.

451
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:07,240
Step back.

452
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,440
Everyone, step back.

453
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,270
Step back.

454
00:26:09,270 --> 00:26:09,850
Okay.

455
00:26:10,070 --> 00:26:11,030
Step back.

456
00:26:20,310 --> 00:26:21,710
The position is a bit far.

457
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:23,470
The position is a bit far!

458
00:26:23,590 --> 00:26:24,400
Look.

459
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:26,350
If he was pushed down,

460
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,600
the landing position

461
00:26:27,830 --> 00:26:28,830
would be further

462
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,030
than if he jumped himself.

463
00:26:30,030 --> 00:26:31,720
This doesn't count as me pushing him.

464
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:32,880
The premise of it being further

465
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,480
is that the victim resisted desperately,

466
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,310
and the killer had to use

467
00:26:35,310 --> 00:26:36,440
a lot of force.

468
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,830
Okay, wait here.

469
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:41,680
Give it to me.

470
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,310
Make way!

471
00:26:56,880 --> 00:26:58,540
Just now it landed on its face,

472
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,840
this time on its back.

473
00:27:01,070 --> 00:27:01,830
Yes.

474
00:27:07,110 --> 00:27:08,910
No matter how determined to die,

475
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,030
people who commit suicide

476
00:27:10,030 --> 00:27:11,480
always look at the ground,

477
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:13,160
usually face down.

478
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:15,160
But if they are pushed,

479
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:17,550
the landing part is uncertain.

480
00:27:19,270 --> 00:27:20,160
And also,

481
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:23,350
suicide victims usually
have a peaceful face.

482
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,790
But if they struggled desperately

483
00:27:25,790 --> 00:27:27,310
and were pushed,

484
00:27:28,070 --> 00:27:30,960
their face would be grim.

485
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,240
Li Si said

486
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,240
Tang Wei had already predicted

487
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,570
that he would die today.

488
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,480
So,

489
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:39,010
he might not have struggled desperately.

490
00:27:48,360 --> 00:27:49,420
Zhenzhu, careful!

491
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:58,200
There's a problem with this railing.

492
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:59,590
It can't bear any weight at all.

493
00:27:59,590 --> 00:28:00,680
In that case,

494
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:01,310
if Boss Tang

495
00:28:01,310 --> 00:28:02,920
didn't know there was
a problem with the railing

496
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,920
and leaned against it

497
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,380
to enjoy the moon as usual,

498
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:07,720
then he would fall down

499
00:28:07,790 --> 00:28:09,390
without anyone pushing him.

500
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:11,590
No wonder we couldn't tell from the body

501
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:13,240
whether he was pushed

502
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:14,960
or fell down himself.

503
00:28:15,880 --> 00:28:17,030
Do you think this railing

504
00:28:17,030 --> 00:28:18,590
is in disrepair

505
00:28:18,590 --> 00:28:19,400
or...

506
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,240
Man-made.

507
00:28:21,830 --> 00:28:22,720
This tenon

508
00:28:22,750 --> 00:28:23,440
was obviously

509
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:24,920
unscrewed on purpose,

510
00:28:25,070 --> 00:28:26,200
not due to

511
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,240
weathering.

512
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:29,720
Lanyue Pavilion has regular maintenance.

513
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:31,480
If such a big mistake was found,

514
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,810
it wouldn't be ignored.

515
00:28:34,030 --> 00:28:35,830
The person in charge of maintenance

516
00:28:35,830 --> 00:28:37,200
seems to be Qin Dayuan.

517
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,500
This person can be investigated.

518
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:40,790
My lords,

519
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:44,310
Constable Qingyang
has already taken Qin Dayuan

520
00:28:44,310 --> 00:28:45,640
to the Divine Constable Bureau.

521
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,480
And before the incident,

522
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,590
the two guests on the sixth floor,

523
00:28:47,590 --> 00:28:48,640
Lord Huang Gang

524
00:28:48,640 --> 00:28:49,680
and Lord Jiang Zeshui,

525
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:50,720
were also taken back

526
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:51,680
by Constable Qingyang.

527
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:53,160
Li Si acts fast.

528
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:55,270
Is there anyone else on the sixth floor

529
00:28:55,270 --> 00:28:57,200
who can be taken back for interrogation?

530
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,070
No, Mr. Yan.

531
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:58,510
We both

532
00:28:58,510 --> 00:28:59,680
have confirmed it.

533
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,640
The sixth floor tonight

534
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,170
was booked by the two lords.

535
00:29:02,310 --> 00:29:03,570
No one else has come up.

536
00:29:04,310 --> 00:29:05,310
To go up and down Lanyue Pavilion,

537
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:06,720
you must pass through the stairs.

538
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,070
To get to the seventh floor,

539
00:29:08,070 --> 00:29:09,670
you must go up floor by floor.

540
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:10,550
So,

541
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,500
if there's a suspect,

542
00:29:12,590 --> 00:29:14,920
it's most likely the two of them.

543
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:19,030
Young Master Qingyang
interrogated me last night.

544
00:29:19,030 --> 00:29:21,430
Lanyue Pavilion has regular maintenance,

545
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,510
which I personally supervise.

546
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:25,000
So it's impossible

547
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,790
for the railing to be unsteady.

548
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,070
What if you have a problem?

549
00:29:38,830 --> 00:29:40,240
Back then, I was

550
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:42,020
just a low-level servant
in the Tang Mansion,

551
00:29:42,020 --> 00:29:43,180
bullied by others.

552
00:29:43,270 --> 00:29:44,510
Thanks to the Master and Young Master

553
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,880
for protecting me many times,

554
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,410
and promoting me to butler.

555
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:49,000
I must repay this favor.

556
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,640
My death is not a pity,

557
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:54,880
but I beg you to find the murderer

558
00:29:55,590 --> 00:29:57,120
to avenge the Young Master.

559
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,880
Steward Qin, get up first.

560
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,230
His pulse shows

561
00:30:16,270 --> 00:30:17,920
palpitations caused by anger,

562
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,960
not panic.

563
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:20,240
He's not lying.

564
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,590
Since Li Si interrogated him,

565
00:30:27,590 --> 00:30:28,720
he's probably fine.

566
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:31,640
It all depends on
the two on the sixth floor.

567
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:58,920
The Crown Prince
had a severe illness in his childhood.

568
00:30:58,920 --> 00:31:00,070
His body was too weak to absorb tonics.

569
00:31:00,070 --> 00:31:01,350
It was our master

570
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:02,640
who, relying on a bowl

571
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:04,270
of porridge that nourished qi and blood,

572
00:31:02,730 --> 00:31:05,850
[Former Head of the Imperial Kitchen,
Huang Gang]

573
00:31:04,270 --> 00:31:06,130
helped the Crown Prince survive.

574
00:31:06,310 --> 00:31:07,830
Come to think of it, our master

575
00:31:07,830 --> 00:31:09,590
has served two emperors

576
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:10,790
and one Crown Prince.

577
00:31:10,790 --> 00:31:12,240
Even if Xuanyuan Shan came,

578
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:14,200
he wouldn't dare to
interrogate our master.

579
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,590
Who are you two to question him?

580
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:24,200
Our Lord Jiang has managed
water systems countless times.

581
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:26,310
He is known as Yu the Great reborn.

582
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:29,030
When the current His Majesty
was still a prince,

583
00:31:26,930 --> 00:31:29,690
[Former River Supervisor, Jiang Zeshui]

584
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,270
it was with the help of

585
00:31:30,270 --> 00:31:31,880
our master

586
00:31:32,030 --> 00:31:34,480
that the dikes on both sides
of the Yellow River were built,

587
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:36,030
saving countless lives.

588
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:39,400
Have you lost your minds

589
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:40,680
to dare question him?

590
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:42,030
Why don't you call that

591
00:31:42,030 --> 00:31:43,200
Xuanyuan Shan out

592
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,240
to give our master

593
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:45,960
a face-to-face apology?

594
00:31:48,750 --> 00:31:49,400
Get out!

595
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:49,960
Master!

596
00:31:49,960 --> 00:31:50,590
Take him away!

597
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:52,040
-Master.
-Master.

598
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:56,030
The Divine Constable Bureau answers
directly to imperial power.

599
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:57,630
No matter what his status is.

600
00:31:58,110 --> 00:31:59,240
Those two lackeys

601
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:01,030
have already been kicked out by me.

602
00:32:01,030 --> 00:32:03,030
If you two lords don't say anything,

603
00:32:03,310 --> 00:32:05,030
I can completely use torture.

604
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:07,080
Whatever the consequences,

605
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,590
I will bear them alone.

606
00:32:11,880 --> 00:32:12,640
Are you hard of hearing?

607
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:14,030
Can't you hear me?

608
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:14,960
Brother Sanhuo.

609
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:20,510
Brother Sanhuo.

610
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,480
Your upright and unyielding character

611
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:24,000
truly makes me admire you.

612
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:26,640
But even if you aren't afraid,

613
00:32:26,790 --> 00:32:27,590
look at them.

614
00:32:27,590 --> 00:32:29,240
With the age of these two elders,

615
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:30,880
let alone severe torture,

616
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:33,110
even staying in jail for a few days,

617
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,200
I'm afraid

618
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,610
they might pass away at any moment.

619
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,210
From what you mean,

620
00:32:42,510 --> 00:32:44,550
not only can we not touch them,

621
00:32:44,830 --> 00:32:46,630
but we also have to worship them.

622
00:32:48,510 --> 00:32:49,680
That's not necessary either—

623
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:51,680
no need to make it that troublesome.

624
00:32:54,590 --> 00:32:56,520
Release Lord Jiang and Lord Huang!

625
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:57,440
Why arrest

626
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:58,900
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang?

627
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:01,000
What evidence do you have?

628
00:33:02,240 --> 00:33:03,350
I think

629
00:33:04,030 --> 00:33:06,030
these two elders
in the Divine Constable Bureau

630
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:07,550
won't stay for long.

631
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:09,440
Release Lord Jiang!

632
00:33:08,620 --> 00:33:10,690
[Divine Constable Bureau]

633
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,400
Why arrest

634
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:11,860
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang?

635
00:33:12,270 --> 00:33:13,920
What evidence do you have?

636
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:16,730
[Divine Constable Bureau]

637
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:16,230
Release them now!

638
00:33:17,310 --> 00:33:18,440
I'll count to three.

639
00:33:18,790 --> 00:33:20,050
If you don't disperse,

640
00:33:20,830 --> 00:33:22,200
the cells in the back courtyard
of the Divine Constable Bureau

641
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,330
are waiting for you.

642
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:26,000
Meng, who are you trying to scare?

643
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:26,880
That's right!

644
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:27,400
Right!

645
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:27,920
One.

646
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:30,110
Don't be afraid, everyone.

647
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:31,480
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang

648
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:33,030
have always treated us well!

649
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:34,680
-Even if we risk our lives today...
-That's right!

650
00:33:34,680 --> 00:33:35,310
Two!

651
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:36,150
we have to save them!

652
00:33:36,150 --> 00:33:37,640
Release Lord Jiang and Lord Huang!

653
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:38,480
Mr. Meng!

654
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:40,400
Mr. Meng, please stop!

655
00:33:39,500 --> 00:33:40,850
[Divine Constable Bureau]

656
00:33:46,110 --> 00:33:47,960
Constable Ghost, stop playing.

657
00:33:47,980 --> 00:33:49,440
Don't hurt Lord Huang

658
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,830
and Lord Jiang.

659
00:33:51,320 --> 00:33:53,020
Are you two eunuchs

660
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:56,000
representing His Majesty
and the Eastern Palace

661
00:33:56,030 --> 00:33:57,400
to plead for mercy?

662
00:33:58,400 --> 00:33:59,310
Lady Xuanyuan.

663
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:01,270
If His Majesty issues an edict,

664
00:34:01,270 --> 00:34:03,590
I will naturally release them.

665
00:34:03,590 --> 00:34:04,310
Well...

666
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:08,880
Lady Xuanyuan,

667
00:34:09,070 --> 00:34:11,030
how could His Majesty
issue an explicit decree

668
00:34:11,030 --> 00:34:12,630
to interfere with the Divine Constable Bureau's
handling of a case?

669
00:34:12,630 --> 00:34:14,510
His Majesty is wise.

670
00:34:15,110 --> 00:34:15,920
You...

671
00:34:18,110 --> 00:34:19,070
You naturally understand

672
00:34:19,070 --> 00:34:19,880
His Majesty's intention.

673
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:21,440
Why pretend to be confused?

674
00:34:21,510 --> 00:34:23,190
The two elders are old,

675
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:26,050
and it's not suitable to torture them.

676
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:29,199
Our Divine Constable Bureau
will treat them well.

677
00:34:35,190 --> 00:34:37,000
Lady Xuanyuan means

678
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:40,480
the Divine Constable Bureau
refuses to release them?

679
00:34:41,030 --> 00:34:42,190
If I

680
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:44,670
release them because of their past status,

681
00:34:44,670 --> 00:34:47,600
our Divine Constable Bureau
will lose its prestige,

682
00:34:48,230 --> 00:34:49,710
but His Majesty

683
00:34:50,230 --> 00:34:51,440
will lose face too.

684
00:34:51,630 --> 00:34:52,920
That's why

685
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:54,710
he didn't issue an explicit decree.

686
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:57,230
You two should know this.

687
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,070
I know.

688
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,230
Never mind, let's go back first.

689
00:35:04,670 --> 00:35:05,480
Take care.

690
00:35:13,230 --> 00:35:14,710
Dismissed. It's nothing.

691
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:23,030
How's the interrogation

692
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:25,590
[Pillar of the Realm]

693
00:35:23,030 --> 00:35:24,360
with Li Si and Yan Cheng?

694
00:35:24,670 --> 00:35:25,800
Strangely,

695
00:35:26,070 --> 00:35:27,400
the two elders neither defend themselves

696
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:28,360
nor panic.

697
00:35:28,630 --> 00:35:30,150
It seems they are

698
00:35:30,150 --> 00:35:31,480
happy about something.

699
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:35,070
And according to the guy
in Lanyue Pavilion,

700
00:35:35,070 --> 00:35:37,280
they booked the private room
on the 6th floor last night.

701
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,840
They neither sought beauties

702
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:40,230
nor invited friends.

703
00:35:40,630 --> 00:35:41,670
Instead,

704
00:35:42,090 --> 00:35:43,820
they were plotting something.

705
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:45,280
So,

706
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:47,030
we have to make them talk.

707
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:49,790
Since we can't torture them,

708
00:35:50,030 --> 00:35:51,070
how should we interrogate them?

709
00:35:51,070 --> 00:35:52,320
Please instruct.

710
00:35:58,710 --> 00:35:59,510
Zhenzhu,

711
00:36:00,070 --> 00:36:02,000
you interrogate them.

712
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:36,230
Trapped in the mortal world
for 80 years,

713
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:39,800
my heart is like
a Taiyi immortal in the water.

714
00:36:40,190 --> 00:36:42,840
Going out with a smile, free of obstacles,

715
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:46,630
clouds in the West Lake, moon in the sky.

716
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:49,230
Pigs and sheep sit on the kang,

717
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:51,590
relatives are boiled in the pot.

718
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,460
Daughters eat their mothers' flesh,

719
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:57,150
sons beat their fathers' skin drums.

720
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:59,920
Relatives come to congratulate,

721
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:03,880
I think it's really bitter.

722
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:13,630
Uncles,

723
00:37:14,110 --> 00:37:15,510
I am Bai Zhenzhu.

724
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:17,960
When I was young, I met you

725
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,320
at my house.

726
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:22,590
So you are the apple of the elder's eye.

727
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:25,430
You are indeed extraordinary.

728
00:37:26,070 --> 00:37:28,590
Since we are on the same path,

729
00:37:28,620 --> 00:37:30,710
we will tell you everything we know.

730
00:37:32,190 --> 00:37:33,590
I have long heard

731
00:37:33,630 --> 00:37:36,150
that Mr. Tang never miscalculates,

732
00:37:36,670 --> 00:37:38,550
and I deeply admire him.

733
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,070
This time, I also want

734
00:37:40,070 --> 00:37:41,510
to ask you two.

735
00:37:42,230 --> 00:37:44,320
Did Mr. Tang really predict

736
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:46,800
his own death long ago?

737
00:37:49,030 --> 00:37:51,670
Before my nephew passed away,

738
00:37:52,630 --> 00:37:55,110
he once told us

739
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:57,800
that there would be imprisonment,

740
00:37:57,800 --> 00:38:00,360
but it wouldn't be a big deal.

741
00:38:05,370 --> 00:38:07,150
[To Lord Huang,
Your Nephew Tang Wei]

742
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:15,590
Approaching the end,
suddenly happy and sad.

743
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:19,030
Gloomy in prison, both safe and dangerous.

744
00:38:19,670 --> 00:38:20,630
Nephew Tang Wei.

745
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:22,920
Autumn of the 37th year of Hongyun.

746
00:38:26,060 --> 00:38:26,750
[With my final return drawing near,
I am at once joyful and sorrowful.
The prison is dark and dreary,
where safety and danger walk hand in hand.]

747
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,030
So

748
00:38:28,030 --> 00:38:30,280
Mr. Tang had already foreseen

749
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:31,320
that you two uncles

750
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:34,050
would be brought to
the Divine Constable Bureau.

751
00:38:39,400 --> 00:38:40,630
Can Tang Wei

752
00:38:41,630 --> 00:38:44,360
really foresee the future?

753
00:38:44,450 --> 00:38:47,760
[Lanyue Pavilion]

754
00:38:53,030 --> 00:38:54,360
Thank you, Steward Qin.

755
00:38:58,030 --> 00:38:59,490
According to your orders,

756
00:38:59,630 --> 00:39:02,160
the private rooms
of Lord Huang and Lord Jiang

757
00:39:03,190 --> 00:39:04,250
remain untouched.

758
00:39:07,670 --> 00:39:08,480
According to the previous

759
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:10,440
statement of the staff in the building,

760
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,510
there have always been only

761
00:39:12,510 --> 00:39:15,660
two guests, Huang Gang
and Jiang Zeshui, on this sixth floor.

762
00:39:15,660 --> 00:39:18,000
But why are there
four sets of bowls and chopsticks?

763
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:20,590
These are the affairs of the lords.

764
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:22,400
Servants like us

765
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:24,840
wouldn't know.

766
00:39:32,470 --> 00:39:33,400
Steward Qin,

767
00:39:35,030 --> 00:39:36,560
I want to ask you a question.

768
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:39,320
There was a middle-aged man

769
00:39:39,480 --> 00:39:41,630
with excellent skills
and a square face with narrow eyes.

770
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:43,440
This person stayed in this Lanyue Pavilion

771
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:45,030
for several days.

772
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:46,850
Do you have any impression?

773
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:53,190
In this Lanyue Pavilion,

774
00:39:53,190 --> 00:39:55,790
with so many people
coming and going every day,

775
00:39:57,670 --> 00:39:59,230
I really can't remember.

776
00:40:10,890 --> 00:40:14,000
What exactly does this thing

777
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:15,200
have to do with Liluo?

778
00:40:21,670 --> 00:40:24,260
[Lanyue Pavilion]

779
00:40:35,460 --> 00:40:38,970
[Lanyue Pavilion]

780
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:50,640
These footprints...

781
00:40:51,960 --> 00:40:52,760
No.

782
00:40:52,940 --> 00:40:55,130
[Lanyue Pavilion]

783
00:40:59,510 --> 00:41:00,280
There are so many carpets

784
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:01,680
laid in Lanyue Pavilion.

785
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:04,070
Walking all the way from
the first floor to the seventh floor,

786
00:41:04,070 --> 00:41:05,030
how could it be possible to leave

787
00:41:05,030 --> 00:41:06,560
such a complete footprint?

788
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:07,550
Right.

789
00:41:08,150 --> 00:41:08,880
No matter how dirty the shoes are,

790
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:10,740
they would have been wiped clean.

791
00:41:12,230 --> 00:41:14,960
That footprint was left on purpose.

792
00:41:26,110 --> 00:41:27,840
To leave a footprint like this,

793
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:29,280
you have to be like me

794
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:30,630
and step down hard.

795
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:32,920
If

796
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:35,920
the killer wanted to sneak up from behind,

797
00:41:36,030 --> 00:41:37,690
how could they walk like this?

798
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:43,710
Therefore,

799
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:45,920
Tang Wei committed suicide.

800
00:41:46,630 --> 00:41:49,320
He left this footprint

801
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:52,630
to create the illusion

802
00:41:52,670 --> 00:41:54,590
that someone was behind him.

803
00:41:55,530 --> 00:41:57,440
But Tang Wei was perfectly fine.

804
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:59,040
Why would he end his own life?

805
00:41:59,880 --> 00:42:00,760
My lords.

806
00:42:02,070 --> 00:42:02,880
We found this suicide note

807
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:03,710
left by Tang Wei

808
00:42:03,610 --> 00:42:05,260
[Suicide Note]

809
00:42:03,710 --> 00:42:04,360
in the account books

810
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,690
at the Lanyue Pavilion.

811
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:07,130
When did you find it?

812
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:09,030
About half an hour ago.

813
00:42:09,030 --> 00:42:09,840
1 PM.

814
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:13,320
We just found out Tang Wei
committed suicide,

815
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,510
and you guys found his suicide note

816
00:42:14,510 --> 00:42:15,440
so quickly?

817
00:42:20,110 --> 00:42:21,360
Writing this letter,

818
00:42:21,630 --> 00:42:23,320
I am still a living person.

819
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:25,260
When you read this letter,

820
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:27,880
I will already be a ghost
in the underworld.

821
00:42:37,110 --> 00:42:38,710
Tang Wei wrote it elegantly.

822
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,880
But between the lines,

823
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:43,010
it reveals something bizarre.

824
00:42:43,710 --> 00:42:44,550
Bizarre?

825
00:42:47,070 --> 00:42:48,630
Tang Wei's parents are dead.

826
00:42:48,630 --> 00:42:50,090
He has no wife or children.

827
00:42:50,630 --> 00:42:51,880
He became a Taoist in recent years,

828
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,880
and doesn't have any close friends.

829
00:42:55,030 --> 00:42:56,400
Then who is this

830
00:42:57,030 --> 00:42:58,510
suicide note written to?

831
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:01,710
Moreover,

832
00:43:03,220 --> 00:43:04,360
[Tang Wei's Note]

833
00:43:03,630 --> 00:43:07,150
who does 'you' refer to?

834
00:43:15,550 --> 00:43:16,360
How is it?

835
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:19,880
Judging from the handwriting,

836
00:43:19,880 --> 00:43:20,880
Mr. Tang's writing

837
00:43:20,880 --> 00:43:22,440
is agile and fast.

838
00:43:22,440 --> 00:43:24,370
The strokes are thin but vigorous,

839
00:43:24,710 --> 00:43:26,630
thin but not losing their flesh.

840
00:43:26,630 --> 00:43:28,110
His large characters especially show

841
00:43:28,110 --> 00:43:29,400
their graceful charm.

842
00:43:29,400 --> 00:43:30,360
Come on.

843
00:43:31,440 --> 00:43:32,190
Just tell me,

844
00:43:32,190 --> 00:43:33,440
is it his or not?

845
00:43:34,230 --> 00:43:36,830
The suicide note
is indeed written by Mr. Tang.

846
00:43:39,960 --> 00:43:40,760
Please.

847
00:43:46,000 --> 00:43:47,000
It seems that

848
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:48,710
Boss Tang really might have

849
00:43:48,710 --> 00:43:49,880
killed himself.

850
00:43:50,630 --> 00:43:51,630
No wonder he could predict

851
00:43:51,630 --> 00:43:52,840
that Lord Huang and Lord Jiang

852
00:43:52,840 --> 00:43:54,300
would face imprisonment.

853
00:43:55,070 --> 00:43:56,000
He staged it himself,

854
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:58,000
jumping down from Lanyue Pavilion.

855
